title_markup: toki QOTD nasa li kute kin e lawa; anu, ilo pana QOTD pi *tawa lili mute*
description: sina ken lawa e pana taso la sina ken nasa pi suli seme lon insa pi lipu RFC 865?
---

// The @links table is inherited. Only this row is restated, for its label.
@links
rfc865  html=https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc865 \
        gemini=gemini://gemini.quux.org/0/Computers/Standards%20and%20Specs/RFC/docs/rfc865.txt \
